c Agenda for Cooperation.\n\nI. Introduction \n\n- China and the EU have a long history of cooperation and a strong partnership.\n- The strategic agenda aims to deepen and strengthen this cooperation.\n\nII. Common Interests and Global Challenges \n\n- Both China and the EU face common challenges such as climate change, pandemics, and terrorism.\n- The two sides agree to work together to address these challenges.\n\nIII. Economic Cooperation \n\n- The EU and China aim to strengthen their economic cooperation, including in areas such as trade, investment, and innovation.\n- The two sides agree to promote economic cooperation and to strengthen their economic ties.\n\nIV. Research and Innovation \n\n- The EU and China agree to strengthen their cooperation in research and innovation, including in areas such as clean energy, biotechnology, and information technology.\n- The two sides agree to promote innovation and to encourage cooperation between EU and Chinese companies.\n\nV. Education and Culture \n\n- The EU and China agree to strengthen their cooperation in education and culture, including in areas such as language teaching, cultural exchange, and people-to-people exchanges.\n- The two sides agree to promote cultural understanding and to encourage people-to-people exchanges.\n\nVI. Global Governance \n\n- The EU and China agree to strengthen their cooperation in global governance, including in areas such as climate change, human rights, and non-proliferation.\n- The two sides agree to promote global governance and to strengthen their cooperation on global issues.\n\nVII. Conclusions \n\n- The strategic agenda aims to deepen and strengthen the cooperation between the EU and China.\n- The two sides agree to work together to address common challenges and to promote cooperation in areas such as economic cooperation, research and innovation, education and culture, and global governance.'}], [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Summarize the input sentence while preserving the exact meaning of the sentence. Do not output any additional explanation. Only output the summary.\nSentence: China-EU 2020 Strategic Agenda for Cooperation.\n\n1.  **I. Strengthening Partnership for Peace and Security**\n    *   Enhance dialogue and cooperation on non-traditional security issues\n    *   Strengthen counter-terrorism and cybersecurity cooperation\n    *   Enhance cooperation on crisis management and disaster relief\n\n2.  **II. Promoting Sustainable Development and Green Growth**\n    *   Enhance cooperation on climate change and environmental protection\n    *   Promote green and low-carbon development\n    *   Enhance cooperation on sustainable development and poverty reduction\n\n3.  **III. Fostering Innovation and Entrepreneurship**\n    *   Enhance cooperation on science, technology, and innovation\n    *   Promote cooperation on research and development\n    *   Enhance cooperation on innovation and entrepreneurship\n\n4.  **IV. Strengthening Economic Cooperation and Trade**\n    *   Enhance cooperation on trade and investment\n    *   Promote cooperation on economic development and poverty reduction\n    *   Enhance cooperation on trade facilitation and customs cooperation\n\n5.  **V. Promoting Social and Cultural Cooperation**\n    *   Enhance cooperation on education and culture\n    *   Promote cooperation on youth and sports\n    *   Enhance cooperation on tourism and cultural exchange\n\n6.  **VI. Strengthening Human Rights and Good Governance**\n    *   Enhance cooperation on human rights and rule of law\n    *   Promote cooperation on good governance and anti-corruption\n    *   Enhance cooperation on human rights and social development\n\n7.  **VII. Enhancing Cooperation on Global Issues**\n    *   Enhance cooperation on global governance and international relations\n    *   Promote cooperation on development cooperation and humanitarian assistance\n    *   Enhance cooperation on global health and pandemics'}], [{'role': 'user', 'conte