['<s>The essence of a sentence is often captured by its main subjects and actions, while descriptive terms provide additional but less central details. With this in mind , this sentence : "if you need to publish the book and you have found one publisher that allows it ." means in one word:"', '<s>The essence of a sentence is often captured by its main subjects and actions, while descriptive terms provide additional but less central details. With this in mind , this sentence : "If you need to publish the book and you have a willing publisher." means in one word:"', '<s>The essence of a sentence is often captured by its main subjects and actions, while descriptive terms provide additional but less central details. With this in mind , this sentence : "A publisher has agreed to publish your book." means in one word:"', '<s>The essence of a sentence is often captured by its main subjects and actions, while descriptive terms provide additional but less central details. With this in mind , this sentence : "Finding a publisher that accepts your book allows you to publish it." means in one word:"', '<s>The essence of a sentence is often captured by its main subjects and actions, while descriptive terms provide additional but less central details. With this in mind , this sentence : "Having found one publisher, you can proceed with the necessary steps." means in one word:"'] 27000
